<title>NEW ZEALAND: W&amp;K year net profit falls 65 percent.</title>
<headline>W&amp;K year net profit falls 65 percent.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to July 31.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    0.62 vs 1.78</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    7.3 vs 21.2</p>
<p>    Div (cents)			    9.0 vs same</p>
<p>    Total div for yr (cents)	  15.0 vs same</p>
<p>    Turnover			     84.73 vs 83.32</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			 1.12 vs 2.29</p>
<p>    Tax				     0.61 vs 0.54</p>
<p>    Equity earnings		     0.10 vs 0.025</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)    8.41 vs same</p>
<p>Dividend carries full imputation credit.</p>
<p>Reg date Nov 22</p>
<p>Ex div   Nov 25</p>
<p>Note - Williams and Kettle is a rural services company.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
